      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Ornn gains an additional bonus Armor and Magic Resist from all sources. Ornn can spend gold to forge non-consumable items anywhere. Additionally, he can create masterwork items for himself and for his allies.",
      "summary_zh": "奥恩可使所有来源的护甲和魔抗加成获得额外提升。 奥恩可在地图的任意位置上花费金钱来锻造非消耗品的装备。 此外，他能为他自己和友方英雄打造杰作武器。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1332180:4025779"
      ]
    },
