      "status_terms_zh": [
        "减速",
        "击飞"
      ],
      "summary_en": "Ornn summons a massive elemental at a location which travels toward him with increasing speed. Enemies run over by the elemental take damage, are slowed and are made Brittle. Ornn can recast the ability to charge into the elemental, redirecting it in the direction he hits it, causing the elemental to affect any enemies it runs over to be knocked up, dealing the same damage and re-applying Brittle.",
      "summary_zh": "奥恩在目标位置召唤一个巨大的岩浆元素，岩浆元素会以逐渐提升的速度跑向奥恩。被岩浆元素途经的敌人会受到伤害、减速效果并被施加易碎效果。奥恩可以再次施放这个技能，以冲向岩浆元素，并在命中岩浆元素时重新导向岩浆元素，使岩浆元素可将途经的任何敌人击飞，造成等额的伤害并再次施加易碎效果。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1332184:4007985"
      ]
